  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Tie Dao Ku recognizes Bai Ning Bing from the Bai clan’s arrest warrant, though she has never learned who he is; he has spent the time since Qing Mao Mountain chasing Fang and Bai through Bai Gu mountain and into Shang clan city, and was left behind there working off a restaurant debt after Bai clan fled Fang Yuan’s blackmail. Her flat “who are you” pours out rage he has been building through that whole pursuit, and he charges the instant the match starts.",
      "chapters": [
        298
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tie_dao_ku",
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "fac_bai_clan_bai_gu_mountain",
        "loc_qing_mao_mountain",
        "loc_bai_gu_mountain",
        "loc_shang_clan_city",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tie Dao Ku commits a close-range set of Iron Hand Gu, Hand Blade Gu and Swift Shadow Gu, and it breaks Bai Ning Bing’s ice blade and drives her back over a hundred steps. Bai Ning Bing commits Ice Edge Gu, Frost Breath Gu, Icicle Gu and Snowball Gu to buy range, and Ice Crystal Gu, her vital Gu, to match him at close quarters. Ice Explosion Gu, detonated inside a blade Tie Dao Ku is parrying, is what ends it.",
      "chapters": [
        298
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_iron_hand_gu",
        "gu_hand_blade_gu",
        "gu_swift_shadow_gu",
        "gu_ice_edge_gu",
        "gu_frost_breath_gu",
        "gu_icicle_gu",
        "gu_snowball_gu",
        "gu_ice_crystal_gu",
        "sys_vital_gu",
        "gu_ice_explosion_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tie Dao Ku loses his left eye and takes a severe wound to the right; he cries defeat, and the hosting Gu Master calls the match. An unseen restraining force built into the stage separates the two of them, cutting off a Bai Ning Bing who is still attacking.",
      "chapters": [
        298
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "outcome",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bai Ning Bing tallies the cost at seventy percent of her primeval essence for a fight that lasted only a short burst, and calls it a pity she could not kill him. The match reshapes her Gu set: she keeps Icicle Gu paired with Ice Explosion Gu as a combination she credits with deciding the fight, and drops Snowball Gu for costing too much primeval essence to sustain in a real battle.",
      "chapters": [
        299
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "standing-afterwards",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
